---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import photo from '../assets/aamir.jpg';
import FeatherFlow from '../components/FeatherFlow.astro';
import Globe from '../components/Globe.astro';
---
<Base title="About me" description="The story of Aamir Khan: from Bangalore to Turkey to Germany, and into building AI products.">
<section class="story-intro">
<div>
<h1>About me</h1>
</div>
<Image src={photo} alt="Aamir Khan" widths={[420,840]} sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 420px" class="about-photo" />
</section>

<section class="story-row">
<h2>My Journey</h2>
<div class="story-split">
<div>
<p>I was born in Bangalore, India. When I was still small, my dad's job took our family to Turkey in 2005. I spent ten years of my childhood in Bursa, then moved to Istanbul for a year of high school. Turkey is where I grew up, made my first friends, and learned that home can be a place you weren't born in.</p>
<p>In November 2016, we packed up again and moved to Germany. We started out in Cologne and later settled in Leonberg. A new country, a new language, and a fresh start, all over again.</p>
<p>Growing up between India, Turkey and Germany shaped how I see the world. Today I speak English, German, Turkish, Hindi and Urdu, and a little Italian. More than the languages, it taught me how to listen, adapt, and feel at home wherever I am.</p>
</div>
<Globe />
</div>
</section>

<section class="story-row">
<h2>Education</h2>
<div>
<p>I have always loved maths. That curiosity led me to study computer science, and I moved to Aachen to complete my bachelor's degree at RWTH Aachen University. I wrote my bachelor's thesis with Bosch. After my studies, I came back to Leonberg.</p>
<p>Alongside my studies, I volunteered at BEST Aachen, the local group of an international student organization, as Vice President for Corporate Relations.</p>
<p>During my studies I met Janu. We quickly became close friends, and that friendship later became the start of my professional path.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="story-row">
<h2>Work</h2>
<div>
<p>Today I am a Technical Project Manager at <FeatherFlow />, a product agency that helps companies and ambitious founders around the world turn AI ideas into real products. I work at the intersection of clients and engineering: scoping products, keeping delivery on track, and making sure what we build solves the actual problem.</p>
<p>I also spent a year as an intern at Bosch in Sales, Strategy and Business Excellence.</p>
<p>My computer science background lets me follow the technical conversation and translate it into clear decisions for the business side.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="story-row">
<h2>Outside of work</h2>
<div>
<p>You will usually find me on a basketball court or in the gym. I also love going to events about personal development. Meeting people who want to grow is one of the best ways I know to keep learning.</p>
<p class="muted" style="margin-top:32px">More of my story is coming soon. Want to talk? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
